      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FASCINATE MARK (3) has missed the frame at his last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when third (19.14) at Q Straight in a Grade 5. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Better than latest and can atone here. LOLA ACES (7) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (19.55) at Q Straight. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Worth another chance. WHISPERING JACK (1) placed three back at this track then out of the placings last couple but moves to box 1 this time where he has performed well. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. CHAMPAGNE TALKS (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
